  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "はっぱを　つるぎのように　あやつり\nあいてを　きりつけて　こうげきする。\nきゅうしょに　あたりやすい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "잎사귀를 칼처럼 이용해\n상대를 베어 공격한다.\n급소에 맞기 쉽다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如用劍般操控葉子\n切斬對手進行攻擊。\n容易擊中要害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une feuille coupante comme une lame entaille l’ennemi.\nTaux de critiques élevé.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Hieb mit scharfkantigem Blatt. Hohe Volltrefferquote.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Acuchilla con una hoja fina. Suele dar un golpe crítico.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Colpisce il bersaglio usando una foglia affilata\ncome una spada. Probabile brutto colpo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user handles a sharp leaf like a sword and\nattacks by cutting its target. Critical hits land\nmore easily.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "はっぱを　剣のように　あやつり\n相手を　切りつけて　攻撃する。\n急所に　当たりやすい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "像用剑一般操纵叶片\n切斩对手进行攻击。\n容易击中要害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Acuchilla con una hoja fina. Suele dar un golpe crítico.",
